<title>UK: T&amp;N jumps after insurance deal.</title>
<headline>T&amp;N jumps after insurance deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in T&amp;N jumped 24-1/2p to 169p at 0804 GMT in pre-market trade on Wednesday after the UK automotive components group said it had agreed a complex insurance deal to limit it potential liabilities from asbestos-related disease claims in the future.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the deal, T&amp;N will pay a one-off premium of 92 million stg</p>
</text>
